---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Code Optimizer — latency-aware suggestions">
<h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-optgreen">Latency-Aware Code Optimizer</h1>
<p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-sm">Submit code plus runtime context. Get profiled hotspots, load-aware bottleneck predictions, three rewritten variants per bottleneck (speed / memory / balanced), a tradeoff dial, and a unified diff. Static analysis only — your code is never executed.</p>
<div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm">
  <a href="/submit" class="bg-optgreen px-4 py-1 font-bold text-editordark">Optimize code</a>
  <a href="/analysis" class="border border-editoredge px-4 py-1">View analysis</a>
  <a href="/history" class="border border-editoredge px-4 py-1">History</a>
</div>
<div class="mt-8 border border-editoredge bg-editorpanel p-4">
  <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-optgreen">Tradeoff dial — how selection works</h2>
  <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-inksoft">score = 0.5·speed + 0.3·memory + 0.2·readability, mapped per variant profile. Default: balanced.</p>
  <div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-center text-xs">
    <div class="border border-optgreen/50 bg-optgreen/10 p-3">
      <p class="font-bold text-optgreen">speed</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-inksoft">10 / 3 / 4</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-inksoft">list comprehensions, map, set precompute</p>
    </div>
    <div class="border border-optamber/50 bg-optamber/10 p-3">
      <p class="font-bold text-optamber">memory</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-inksoft">3 / 10 / 6</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-inksoft">generators, streaming, lazy joins</p>
    </div>
    <div class="border border-editoredge bg-editordark p-3">
      <p class="font-bold">balanced</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-inksoft">7 / 7 / 8</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-inksoft">commented, readable transforms</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-inksoft">Predicted times are heuristic estimates (signal base × log10(scale+10)), labelled as such. Variants that match nothing carry the original with an honest “no safe transform” note.</p>
</div>
<h2 class="mt-8 text-lg font-bold">How it works</h2>
<ol class="mt-2 list-decimal space-y-1 pl-6 text-sm text-zinc-300">
  <li>Submit code + traffic / data volume / input size.</li>
  <li>Read hotspot severities and the call graph.</li>
  <li>Compare speed / memory / balanced variants, turn the dial, view the diff.</li>
</ol>
</BaseLayout>
